  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training for Transformation programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organise and facilitate two long-term training programmes with experienced trainers who have adapted and tried new models of community education.

Recruit teams who can work together geographically from no more than 12 countries.

Organise field work, following up community development efforts and linking teams to global networks between the training phases, ultimately linking the marginalised communities into global networks.

Develop and disseminate popular materials on global economic issues such as African debt and global trends.</narrative>
  </description>
